 A60 NVMe PCIe Gen 3</dd></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><dt class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-ink-muted font-medium\">Storage 2</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">512GB Silicon Power A55 SATA SSD</dd></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><dt class=\"w-24 shrink-0 text-ink-muted font-medium\">Extras</dt><dd class=\"text-ink\">Intel 3168-AX WiFi5 with Eightwood antenna kit, Dual USB 2.0 Type A ports (rear panel), Rear audio jack</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">Thermals</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted mb-4\">Ambient: <!-- -->23<!-- -->°C</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Part</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Idle</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Gaming</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Stress</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink-muted uppercase text-xs font-semibold\">apu</td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>37<!-- -->–<!-- -->39<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>50<!-- -->–<!-- -->60<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums font-medium\"><span>73<!-- -->–<!-- -->78<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">36w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink-muted uppercase text-xs font-semibold\">cpu</td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>39<!-- -->–<!-- -->45<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums\"><span>50<!-- -->–<!-- -->55<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums font-medium\"><span>63<!-- -->–<!-- -->67<!-- -->°C</span></td><td class=\"py-2.5 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">43w</td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Benchmarks</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R23</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">5,982</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">43<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">626</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">956</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">43<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">356</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">36<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">600</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">59</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">36<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">842</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">33.4</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">36w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">363</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">14.4</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">36w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">693</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">11.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">36w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">439</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">7.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">36w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">ASRock Deskmini 310 barebone build with i7-9700T. Build took less than an hour and was straightforward. The 48mm CPU clearance accommodated the Thermalright AXP90-x36 cooler well. Optional dual USB 2.0 Type A rear ports and audio jack were added. The i7-9700T, despite being an 8-core processor, performs slowly due to its neutered 35W TDP limitation. This is adequate for everyday use but not suitable for AAA gaming. The unit is powered by a 120W 19V brick PSU. Performance is similar to Intel NUCs but superior to true nano builds. A traditional mini-ITX SFF build would perform better. These builds can exceed $1,000 when fully configured with CPU, cooler, memory, storage, and WiFi components.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">5,982</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:3%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->97<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">139.1</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">28<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">14.4<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->100<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">0.4</span> fps/w</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-8\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold text-ink mb-1\">ComponentWatch</p><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted max-w-xs\">Community-verified benchmarks and real-world data for small-form-factor PC builders.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-12 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Explore</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/compare\">Compare</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/ai-builds\">AI Builds</a></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Community</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\" href=\"/submit\">Submit a build</a><a href=\"https://reddit.com/r/sffpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink\">r/sffpc</a></div></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> ComponentWatch. Prices updated every 30 minutes via affiliate links.</p></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-928fbb6057b777a4.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.