hildren\":\"Builder notes\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\",\"children\":\"ASRock Deskmini 310 barebone build with i7-9700T. Build took less than an hour and was straightforward. The 48mm CPU clearance accommodated the Thermalright AXP90-x36 cooler well. Optional dual USB 2.0 Type A rear ports and audio jack were added. The i7-9700T, despite being an 8-core processor, performs slowly due to its neutered 35W TDP limitation. This is adequate for everyday use but not suitable for AAA gaming. The unit is powered by a 120W 19V brick PSU. Performance is similar to Intel NUCs but superior to true nano builds. A traditional mini-ITX SFF build would perform better. These builds can exceed $1,000 when fully configured with CPU, cooler, memory, storage, and WiFi components.\"}]]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Performance\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\",\"children\":\"CPU — CB23 Multi\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\",\"children\":\"5,982\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"3%\"}}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\",\"children\":[\"top \",97,\"%\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-med